  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unlocking a Sustainable Blue Economy in the South West Indian Ocean - Ke</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to generate a shift to a sustainable blue economy by:
&#x2022; Developing, adopting and implementing sustainable blue economy (SBE) policies in at least 3 Africa countries,
&#x2022; Financial institutions adopting SBE principles and align their financing 
&#x2022; Fair and equitable access to and sustainable management of fisheries resources in the SWIO region 
&#x2022; At least 3 SWIO countries combat IUU fishing and implement the Port Sate Measures Agreement</narrative>
  </description>
